{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low And Furious (LAF) is a driving game that allows you to customize your dream car with modifications such as lowering, tinting windows, upgrading the sound system, changing the wheels, and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to car customization, you can also take part in street races to earn reputation and complete missions to gather money, enabling you to enhance your current car or acquire new vehicles and garages. The setting is inspired by Brazil, with the game featuring favelas and other iconic locations that create an engaging and immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LAF is a tribute to classic games, featuring modernized graphics and gameplay, designed to captivate both racing enthusiasts and those passionate about customizing cars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do Drifts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408060/extras/ac09de312c25801897d924d19e39cea7.poster.avif?t=1771279316\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408060/extras/ac09de312c25801897d924d19e39cea7.webm?t=1771279316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408060/extras/ac09de312c25801897d924d19e39cea7.mp4?t=1771279316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open World Map:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2408060/extras/4f5ea1a1543b05cd3c6975d6a07ac54e.poster.avif?t=1771279316\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/24